Andros Anthropos is a ten-foot-tall human man who introduces himself as a totally normal human man. He is a doctor and a guardian, wears heavy armor, and carries a clockwork shield. He has darkvision.

He works with [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Cedric Corot|Cedric Corot]] and [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Krod Snodman|Krod Snodman]] in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. He has been with them into the [[Verdant Expanse]], where he treated the boy [[People/Tommy Lagerman|Tommy Lagerman]], and to [[Org/Crystal's Rock|Crystal's Rock]] and the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Gullet/index|Gullet]]. He keeps a charcoal etching of the half-tree carving left on the door of Cedric's magical mansion.
